In this case, it's important to return only an integerâso a simple division
won't do. It's also important to only return actually elapsed seconds. (That's
why this code uses [ ` Math.floor() ` ](/en-
US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Math/floor) , and _not_ [ `
Math.round() ` ](/en-
